{
  "slug": "notion",
  "name": "Notion",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Notion workspace integration. Search pages, create and update documents, manage databases, and access your team's knowledge base directly from Claude Code for seamless documentation workflows.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Commands** (6): `create-database-row` (Insert a new row into a specified Notion database using natural-language property values), `create-page` (Create a new Notion page, optionally under a specific parent, using the Notion Workspace Skill and Notion MCP…), `create-task` (Create a new task in the user’s Notion tasks database with sensible defaults), `database-query` (Query a Notion database by name or ID and return structured, readable results), `find` (Quickly find pages or databases in Notion by title keywords), `search` (Search the user’s Notion workspace using the Notion MCP server and Notion Workspace Skill)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `notion`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install notion@claude-plugins-official` from `makenotion/claude-code-notion-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "command": 6,
    "mcp": 1
  },
